  "reasoning": "The defendant Yang operated a Chinese medicine department and, without obtaining a drug production license, purchased raw Chinese herbal materials, repackaged them, affixed labels, and sold the products. This constitutes manufacturing and selling medicinal products without the required licensing, which under Chinese criminal law is the crime of illegal production and sale of drugs (非法生产、销售药品罪). No other distinct criminal conduct is described, so only this charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法生产、销售药品<eoa>"
}
